====================================================================================================
A. NOT identities on 10^5 random signed 200-bit integers and all |n| <= 10^5
====================================================================================================
  True  NOT(3x+1) = 3 NOT(x) + 1
  True  NOT T NOT (m) = 3m/2 | (m-1)/2
  True  NOT T NOT (m) = T_minus(m+1) - 1
  True  T_(3n+1) = 9 T_n + 1
  True  halving does not commute: NOT(x/2) != NOT(x)/2 always (NOT(x) is odd)
  True  NOT commutes with x -> q x + (q-1)/2 for q = 3, 7, 11, 15 (3x+1, 7x+3, 11x+5, 15x+7)

